{
    "title": "USA Geography - Quiz Game",
    "description": "Discover the United States of America and become an expert in USA geography. Learn everything about USA geography in easy and entertaining way competing with players from around the world. With USA Geography \u2013 Quiz Game you can learn: all the states with their capitals and largest cities, flags and seals, state mottos and nicknames, maps and border outlines, rivers and lakes, national parks and monuments, highest points and mountain ranges, and even Indian reservations. Want to go deeper? Learn all the counties of all 50 states. In addition, in our App you can find and learn a lot of statistical information, such as: population, area size, population density, GDP per capita and income by state, and many others.\r\n\r\nDo you know the capital of California? Can you find Florida on the map? And how about Washington or Hawaii? Which river is longer, Missouri or Mississippi? Which state is bigger, Texas or Alaska? Can you list all the great lakes of USA? Are you able to recognize New York, Chicago and San Francisco by a photo?\r\nYou can find answers to this questions and test your knowledge with our USA Geography - Quiz Game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the United States of America and become an expert in USA geography. Learn everything about USA geography in easy and entertaining way competing with players from around the world. With USA Geography \u2013 Quiz Game you can learn: all the states with their capitals and largest cities, flags and seals, state mottos and nicknames, maps and border outlines, rivers and lakes, national parks and monuments, highest points and mountain ranges, and even Indian reservations. Want to go deeper? Learn all the counties of all 50 states. In addition, in our App you can find and learn a lot of statistical information, such as: population, area size, population density, GDP per capita and income by state, and many others.<br><br>Do you know the capital of California? Can you find Florida on the map? And how about Washington or Hawaii? Which river is longer, Missouri or Mississippi? Which state is bigger, Texas or Alaska? Can you list all the great lakes of USA? Are you able to recognize New York, Chicago and San Francisco by a photo?<br>You can find answers to this questions and test your knowledge with our USA Geography - Quiz Game.",
